{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22331","headline":"青龙寺早夏 · 白居易","name":"青龙寺早夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘埃经小雨，地高倚长坡。\n日西寺门外，景气含清和。\n闲有老僧立，静无凡客过。\n残莺意思尽，新叶阴凉多。\n春去来几日，夏云忽嵯峨。\n朝朝感时节，年鬓闇蹉跎。\n胡爲恋朝市，不去归烟萝。\n青山寸步地，自问心如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}